// `produces:` beside an answer whose builder has already chosen its media type. `listing_encoder`
// writes the page envelope as JSON by hand -- there is no derived converter in it to write
// `content`/`totalElements` as CSV columns or a YAML document with -- so naming a format is asking
// for something it cannot give, and is refused rather than ignored. The rule `unit` and
// `count_encoder` already follow.
#![derive(Routes)]

